MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt12Intro::
	.string "You rotten little pest!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt12Defeat::
	.string "Grrrr...$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt12::
	.string "Heh, only the boss knows the password\n"
	.string "for that door.\p"
	.string "Where’s the boss?\n"
	.string "Who knows? Go look for yourself.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt26Intro::
	.string "Oh, a kid? I don’t really like this,\n"
	.string "but eliminate you I must.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt26Defeat::
	.string "I knew I’d lose…$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt26::
	.string "I got wiped out on the last mission\n"
	.string "by a kid too.\p"
	.string "When we were abducting POKéMON,\n"
	.string "this kid with long red hair and\l"
	.string "mean looking eyes just creamed me…$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Meteorite_1::
	.string "The door’s closed...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} entered the password.\p"
	.string "The door opened!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Meteorite_2::
	.string "The door’s closed...\n"
	.string "It needs a password to open.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt27Intro::
	.string "The door won’t open?\p"
	.string "Well, duh.\n"
	.string "It has to have a password that\l"
	.string "only TEAM ROCKET knows.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt27Defeat::
	.string "What? I lost?$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt27::
	.string "Heh, I’m just a GRUNT.\p"
	.string "I don’t know the password. Too bad\n"
	.string "for you.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_1::
	.string "LANCE: That odd signal has finally\n"
	.string "stopped.\p"
	.string "The LAKE should be back to normal.\p"
	.string "You’re the hero!\n"
	.string "Let me thank you on behalf of\l"
	.string "all the POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Oh, yes. You should take this.\p"
	.string "I found it here, but I don’t have\n"
	.string "any need for it.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_3::
	.string "That’s WHIRLPOOL.\n"
	.string "Teach it to a POKéMON to get\l"
	.string "across wild water.\p"
	.string "But keep this in mind.\p"
	.string "You can use that out of battle only\n"
	.string "with the BADGE from MAHOGANY GYM.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_4::
	.string "{PLAYER}...\p"
	.string "The journey to becoming the POKéMON\n"
	.string "MASTER is long and difficult.\p"
	.string "Knowing that, will you keep going?\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I see. No, you’re right.\p"
	.string "If you would give up that easily,\n"
	.string "you would have never chased that\l"
	.string "dream in the first place.\p"
	.string "I look forward to seeing you again!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_5::
	.string "LANCE: That did it.\n"
	.string "We defeated all the ROCKETS here.\p"
	.string "But I’m concerned about the young\n"
	.string "guy I battled in the process...$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_6::
	.string "Sorry, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "I saw how well you were doing,\l"
	.string "so I just hung back.\p"
	.string "Now all there is left to do is to\n"
	.string "turn off that odd radio signal.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Lance_7::
	.string "It’s this machine that’s causing all\n"
	.string "the problems.\p"
	.string "I don’t see a switch on it...\p"
	.string "We have no choice.\n"
	.string "We have to make all the\l"
	.string "ELECTRODE faint.\p"
	.string "That should stop this machine from\n"
	.string "transmitting that strange signal.\p"
	.string "It’s no fault of the POKéMON, so it\n"
	.string "makes me feel guilty.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, let’s split the job.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "LANCE: Are you all right?\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON are hurt and tired.\p"
	.string "Here, give them some of my medicine.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "LANCE: {PLAYER}, let’s give it our\n"
	.string "best for POKéMON.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3_1::
	@ ShinyGold: overlapping data duplicated from 0x08785330
	.string "Hold it right there!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3_2::
	.string "We can’t have a brat like you on\n"
	.string "the loose.\p"
	.string "It’s harmful to TEAM ROCKET’s\n"
	.string "pride, you see.\p"
	.string "However strong you may be, you can’t\n"
	.string "take both of us at the same time.\p"
	.string "Sorry, baby. Now get ready to be\n"
	.string "thrashed.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3_3::
	.string "Hey! Don’t be so selfish. Spread\n"
	.string "the fun around.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3_4::
	.string "What? You had an accomplice?\p"
	.string "Where is your sense of honor?\p"
	.string "As the interim boss in place of\n"
	.string "GIOVANNI, I’ll show you how wrong\l"
	.string "it is to meddle with TEAM ROCKET!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3Defeat::
	.string "Tch, you really are strong.\p"
	.string "It’s too bad.\p"
	.string "If you were to join TEAM ROCKET,\n"
	.string "you could become an EXECUTIVE.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3Victory::
	.string "Yes, go TEAM ROCKET!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger3_5::
	.string "...This hideout is done for...\p"
	.string "But that’s fine.\n"
	.string "The broadcast experiment was\l"
	.string "a total success.\p"
	.string "It doesn’t matter what happens to\n"
	.string "this hideout now.\p"
	.string "We have much bigger plans.\p"
	.string "You’ll come to appreciate TEAM\n"
	.string "ROCKET’s true power soon enough.\p"
	.string "Enjoy yourself while you can...\p"
	.string "Fufufufu...$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B2F_Text_Trigger6::
	.string "LANCE: Leave this side to me.$"
